    "library_text": "In certain situations, such as the final stage of a fight, it can be very useful to have an extremely powerful attack. For this reason, some clever mages have developed a stance that allows a knight to raise his weapon skills significantly. During this time, the knight is in a Blood Rage that gives him incredible attack power but clouds his awareness to a certain degree as well, taking additional damage. A knight is versatile, however and can alter quickly between an aggressive and a defensive stance by casting Protector to remove Blood Rage.",
